
# ==================================================================================================
# 📇 BUSINESS CARDS API - INTERACTIVE TUTORIAL
# ==================================================================================================
# 🚀 QUICK START GUIDE:
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1️⃣ AUTHENTICATE: Go to 'users.rest', run "Login", and copy the token.
# 2️⃣ SETUP TOKEN: Paste that token into @authToken below.
# 3️⃣ CREATE CARD: Run "Request 4" to create a card, then copy its "_id".
# 4️⃣ SETUP ID: Paste that ID into @cardId below.
# 5️⃣ TEST: Now you can run all other card management requests.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@authToken =
@cardId =

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 🟢 PART 1: PUBLIC EXPLORATION (No Token Needed)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Request 1: Browse All Cards
# See every public business card in the system.
GET {{baseUrl}}/cards

### Request 2: View Specific Card
# Uses @cardId to fetch a single card's details.
GET {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 🔵 PART 2: CARD MANAGEMENT (Requires @authToken)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Request 3: View My Cards
# List only the cards that belong to your authenticated account.
GET {{baseUrl}}/cards/my-cards
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Request 4: Create New Business Card
# Only works if your user is a Business user or Admin.
POST {{baseUrl}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

