### Request 6: Toggle Like/Unlike
# Add or remove your like from a card.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Request 7: Update Business Number (Admin Only)
# Change the unique identifier of a card (Requires Admin status).
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}/biz-number
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bizNumber": 7774441
}

### Request 8: Delete Card
# Permanently remove a card (Owner or Admin only).
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
